  the one that produced the archive, and nothing below may be read.
    freezing f3, amp 1.0:  dd'^2   +2.934 +-  0.154  against +2.934  -> REPRODUCES

  WIRING CHECK, NOT A CONTROL. At bw_gain 0 the renderer uses the literal
  90.0f for every bandwidth and never reads the commanded values, so
  freezing them is bit-exactly inert and this MUST be exactly 0. It cannot
  fail for a measured reason; the control that can is clause 4.
    all 7 axes x both bw_gain-0 cells, freeze bw1/bw2/bw3  -> exactly 0, as the renderer forces

